  new <url> block for every page added to the site.

  Tag meanings:
    loc        - the full, absolute URL of the page (required)
    lastmod    - date the page was last modified, format YYYY-MM-DD
    changefreq - how often the page is expected to change (a hint, not a rule)
    priority   - importance of this page relative to others on THIS site,
                 from 0.0 to 1.0; does not affect ranking against other sites
-->
